---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure - The Modern Pantry">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-16 px-4 md:px-0 bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-orange max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-8 text-brand-text">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      
      <p class="lead">
        At The Modern Pantry, we believe in transparency. We want you to know exactly how this website operates and how we generate revenue to keep providing you with high-quality recipes and kitchen recommendations.
      </p>

      <h2>The Short Version</h2>
      <p>
        The Modern Pantry is a participant in various affiliate marketing programs, primarily the AliExpress Affiliate Program. This means that when you click on certain product links on our site and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission <strong>at absolutely no additional cost to you</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p>
        Throughout our recipe pages and "Kitchen Finds" sections, you will see links pointing to specific products (such as Chef's Knives, Meat Thermometers, etc.). These links contain a special tracking code. When you click one of these links and buy the product on AliExpress, the seller pays us a small percentage of the sale as a "thank you" for referring you.
      </p>
      
      <div class="bg-brand-green/10 p-6 rounded-xl my-8 border-l-4 border-brand-green">
        <p class="m-0 font-medium text-brand-green">
          <strong>Important:</strong> You do not pay more when buying through an affiliate link. The price remains exactly the same for you whether you use our link or go directly to the store.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Our Commitment to You</h2>
      <p>
        Our integrity is more important than any commission. We only recommend tools, gadgets, and ingredients that we genuinely believe are of high quality and offer good value. While we may receive compensation, our reviews and recommendations are always honest and objective.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        If you have any questions regarding our affiliate relationships, please don't hesitate to reach out to us via our <a href="/about/contact">Contact Page</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
        Last updated: May 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
